    },
    {
     "q": "What happens to the ammonia from chloramine?",
     "a": "Some passes the reverse osmosis membranes as ammonia gas, at the pH used to control CO₂. It then loads the electrodeionization stage, so we design chloramine removal and the Purified Water skid together."
